        <mxCell id="p0-systemov-26" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Simulated by &lt;b&gt;ztc-edge&lt;/b&gt;. Every device has its own SPIFFE ID, e.g. &lt;i&gt;spiffe://grid.example/edge/pmu/pmu-b1-1&lt;/i&gt;, and its own short-lived credential.&lt;/span&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#222222;" vertex="1" parent="p0-edgeb">
