        <mxCell id="p0-systemov-28" value="&lt;b&gt;Safety first&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Protection (GOOSE trips on the process bus) runs locally and never waits for the PEP. ZTC observes it and never gates it. In OT the order is safety → availability → integrity → confidentiality." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="p0-edgeb">
